# Watch List

> 这份文件由 Dataview 自动从所有带 `status` 字段的笔记生成。
> **不用手动维护链接**——给笔记加 frontmatter 就会自动出现在对应栏目。
>
> **前置：** 在 Obsidian 中安装 Community Plugin **Dataview**，否则代码块会原样显示。
>
> 每次 weekly / biweekly review 时扫一遍：
> - 先看 ⚠️ 到期未处理 一栏，逐项决策
> - 把 status 改成 active / abandoned / 推 next-review，对应栏目自动更新

## ⚠️ 到期未处理（next-review 已过）

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link as "笔记",
  status as "状态",
  priority as "优先级",
  next-review as "应 review"
FROM ""
WHERE status AND next-review <= date(today)
SORT next-review ASC
```

## 🔭 Watching（等条件触发）

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link as "笔记",
  priority as "优先级",
  next-review as "下次 review",
  trigger-condition as "触发条件"
FROM ""
WHERE status = "watching"
SORT next-review ASC
```

## 🤔 Considering（还在想要不要做）

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link as "笔记",
  priority as "优先级",
  next-review as "下次 review",
  trigger-condition as "关键决策点"
FROM ""
WHERE status = "considering"
SORT next-review ASC
```

## 🚀 Active（正在做）

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link as "笔记",
  priority as "优先级",
  next-review as "下次 review"
FROM ""
WHERE status = "active"
SORT priority DESC
```

## ✅ Done

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link as "笔记",
  created as "起步于"
FROM ""
WHERE status = "done"
SORT file.mtime DESC
LIMIT 10
```

## ❌ Abandoned

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link as "笔记",
  created as "起步于"
FROM ""
WHERE status = "abandoned"
SORT file.mtime DESC
LIMIT 10
```

---

## 维护规则

- **新增带跟进属性的笔记** → 在 frontmatter 加 `status: watching/considering/active`，next-review、priority 等字段。**不需要**来这个文件加链接
- **状态变化** → 直接改笔记的 frontmatter，本文件视图自动刷新
- **想用普通 markdown 表格代替**（备份方案）→ 删除 dataview 代码块，改回手动表格

## 写新笔记的快捷模板

复制粘贴到新建笔记顶部：

```yaml
---
status: watching
priority: medium
next-review: YYYY-MM-DD
review-cadence: monthly
trigger-condition: "..."
created: YYYY-MM-DD
---
```

字段全部说明见 `routing.md` 的"项目 / Idea 的状态标记规范"章节。
